*======================================================================
* SPICE Model generated by Coilcraft
* Coilcraft Part Number : 2712SP-10N
* Inductance = 10nH
*======================================================================
* Model Parameters:
*   Valid Frequency Range = 1MHz-5GHz
*   Ambient Temperature = 25 degC
*   Inductor TLine Model
*   Use model for Frequency Domain simulations
*======================================================================
.subckt 2712SP-10N port1 port2 PARAMS: Cpar=0.232pF
X1 port1 port2 Model3A PARAMS:
+ R1=5.5
+ R2=0.0031
+ C= {Cpar}
+ K1=0.0000077
+ L_Z0=270
+ L_EL=29
+ L_F0=2200E6
.ends 2712SP-10N

